72,"\\""  A explosive laden truck ble explosion at a camp for Egyptian forces Tuesday morning, killing one civilian, injuring 44 others, and 42 soldiers. Guards shot at the truck as it approached the gate, causing explosion. No one has claimed responsibility for the attack yet, as the Egyptian army battles Islamist insurgency in North Sinai, which has increased since the ouster of Islamist President Mohamed Morsi in 2013. 2. What were the most significant events in this article? Most important information:  On a smaller scale, the fact that the truck was shot at by guard before it exploded may be significant, as it may help investigators in determining who was behind the attack. This is fledgling information. The attack itself is the most significant aspect of article. 3. In your opinion, who was the most important person/agency involved in this article? Why? In this article, Egyptian army is the most important agency involved, since it is fighting an Islamist insurgency, and the attack was directed at its forces. The fact that the army is fighting an insurgency is key to\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.03940886699507389,0.812402069568634,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,25.83797022420913,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
