128,"\\"" (upcoming)  .Ruth Bader Ginsburg birthday tributes paid tribute to the justice through the use of social media memes. She earned nickname The Notorious R.B.G. for her viewsSimilarities Between Theory and Research Article: (CNN)It's no secret that Supreme Court Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg has a young, liberal fanbase that shows its devotion in distinctly millennial ways. Her positions on wage parity, same-sex marriage, and women's rights (to name few) have earned her the nickname ""The Notorious R.B.G."" thanks to tumblr of the same name dedicated to her. There are tattoos, muscle tees and YouTube serenades paying homage to the soft-spoken justice, who has been on the nation's highest bench for 21 years -- longer than some of her followers have been alive. So it seems appropriate that her fans would celebrate her birthday with social media memes, the Internet's favorite tool for honoring/ mocking public figures. Often, research articles are more formal and formal and calm, lacking in the casual\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.06122448979591837,0.7922611832618713,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,22.201196795795113,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
