411,"\\""  A swimming complex in New Zealand, Splash Palace, has been hit by a mysterious series of feces incidents, with a person or group of people defecating in pool after pool on five consecutive Friday nights, causing six hours of cleaning time each time and disrupting business. The-mystery 'pooper' or 'poopers' have targeted different pool areas, forcing the facility to shut down entirely on one occasion, with one instance involving diarrhea. The incidents occurred after 5pm on Friday evenings, and it unclear if single person or multiple people are behind the incidents.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.10144927536231885,0.8055701851844788,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,15.706785285845399,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
412,"\\"" A US drone strike in Somalia killed Adan Garar and two others suspected to plan Westgate shopping mall attack in 2013, Kenyan officials say. Garar was a top member of the al-Shabab extremist group and is believed to have coordinated the attack and three failed attacks on Kenya's coastal city of Mombasa, the capital of Kenya. Al-Shabab, an Islamic extremist group, has vowed to launch violent attacks on Kenya and Uganda because the two countries have troops in Somalia.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.053097345132743355,0.8065056800842285,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,15.238479631952941,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
