414,"\\"" Valencia won a 2-0 victory over Real Sociedad, thanks to a pair of goals from Pablo Piatti. This improves their chances of qualifying for the Champions League next season, as they now sit four points ahead of Sevilla, who are in fifth place. This marks Valencia's sixth win in their last seven games, and they are now level with third place Atlético Madrid, who they will face next weekend. 3. After missing out on a place in Europe last term, Valencia is now in a position to qualify for the luc lucrative berth in the Champions League for next season, thanks to their current form and the recent takeover by Singapore billionaire Peter Lim, which may help them sort out their finances and become competitive again.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.25842696629213485,0.8864204287528992,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,16.045862923376262,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
