672,"\\"" The Australian cr team will receive a $5 million prize should they win the World cup tonight against New Zealand. In a rarely seen move in sport, they will split the prize funds evenly down the middle of 15 players who made the squad for the 6 week competition, which means that even players that didn't play a single game will get $340k. The New Zealand team won't be so lucky, with only the players that played the most games receiving a prize from the pool.
