682,"\\"" Cornerback Byron Maxwell is leaving the Seattle Seahawks and joining the Philadelphia Eagles. ESPN reports that Maxwell, who played for the Super Bowl runner-up Seahawks, told the sports network that he is joining the Philadelphia team. Maxwell is considered one of the best cornerbacks in the NFL and will help strengthen the Eagles’ secondary.  The first paragraph should only include the most important information and should be a sentences long. Byron Maxwell, a cornerback for the Seattle Seahawks and a crucial part of the team's successful run, is moving to the Philadelphia Eagles. Frank Gore would become the Eagles’ next big purchase. Maxwell’s move comes as the Eagles parted ways with Cary Williams and Bradley Fletcher. The 27 year old Maxwell is considered one of the NFL's top rated cornerbacks, and it’s only logical that the Eagles scoop him immediately, as they have a poor record of interceptions and passes defensed. \\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.04145077720207254,0.7985291481018066,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,22.61792549304664,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
