805,"\\"" Manny Pacquiao treated reporters to rendition of his entrance song, ""I Will Fight for Philippines,"" an unreleased track he collaborated on with Filipino singer/songwriter Lito Camo, before the press conference in Los Angeles. contrasting his entrance music, Floyd Mayweather typically prefers rap and had Justin Bieber walk him to the ring for his first fight against Marcos Maidana last year. On the other hand, Pacquiao and F.Mayweather, Jr. will come out ready to conquer on their $300 million dollar Las Vegas showdown on May 2nd.
A Manny-Floyd music battle?
Manny Pacquiao plans to make Floyd Mayweather J Jr dance to his tune on May 2, and the Filipino icon gave fans a sample of his entrance music as the pair came head to head in Losc Angeles.
