810,"\\"" Andy Murray is trial-testing Swedish former world No 4 Jonas Bjorkman as a new assistant coach for the upcoming tennis season, to replace Dani Vallverdu who left the team in November and is now working with Czech Tomas Berdych. Bjorkman, who is currently on TV commitments for the Swedish version of Strictly Come Dancing, will work with Murray for a trial period of one week after his TV stint is over. A former world No 4, Bjorkman brings experience in tennis, having reached the semi-finals at Wimbledon and the US Open and winning nine doubles titles at the four Grand Slams.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.07246376811594202,0.813698947429657,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,14.992746715899557,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
