887,"\\"" A baby hippopotamus born at San Diego Zoo is seen on camera exploring the water with help from its mother, Funny. And Otis, the father hippo, has been separated temporally since the birth. Hippo matriarch Funny has a history of successful births, and zookeepers report this latest baby is a healthy addition. 1. Z zookeepers are great at watching newborn hippos. 9. Funny was born in Ohio but moved to Texas almost two decades ago. 2. Hippos make great moms. 8. The baby and his mother are getting to know each other. 3. That's so cute, we're gonna need a hippo emoji. 7. To protect the baby, the father hippo was removed for a little while. 4. Funsi's latest baby is the 11th she has had. 5. The San Diego Z zookeepers take care of the hippos. 6. You can learn a lot about nurturing from watching hippos. 10. Hippos are very caring towards their young. 11.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.07368421052631578,0.7958468794822693,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,24.646726008038968,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
888,"\\"" Cesc Fabregas said that he is very happy at Chelsea because he is playing every match and feels he's important to the team. He said that he did not lost his spot at the national team, Spain, because the coach may have chosen better players. Cesc is currently on duty with Spain for their game against Holland. ""I am going through a great moment, both personally and athletically. I have no reason not to be happy. I enjoy everything that happens to me"" “I am practically playing minute for my team and that’s what makes me happy. To be important is fundamental.” ""I do not think I’ve lost place in team because I’ve never been undisputed, the important thing is the team and if the coach does not put you, it is because they are better"" 
