This article is about Floyd Mayweather’s training for his upcoming boxing match against Manny Pacquiao. The article mentions how he has been using old-fashioned training methods, such as chopping wood, to prepare for the fight. This is contrasted with modern training methods, which have largely replaced these traditional methods. Floyd Mayweather has been sharing videos of his training on his Inst Instagram account, including a video of him chopping wood.
