1355,"\\"" Everton manager Roberto Martine utilizes the running track at Dynamo Kiev's Olympic Stadium for training due to concerns over the condition of the pitch. Martinez believes the poor condition of pitch will be problematic for both his team and Dynamo Kiev. The teams will adapt to the surface, which Martinez considers a disappointment for football.

Everton manager Roberto Martinez feels that the poor condition of the pitch at Dynamo Kiev's Olympic Stadium is a concern for both teams in their upcoming Europa League match. In response, Martinez opted to train the team on the running track surrounding the pitch instead of on the actual pitch itself. Martinez acknowledges that it will be a equal disadvantage for both teams but laments that the condition of pitch is not ideal for a game of football.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.07608695652173914,0.808106005191803,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,21.631475160829723,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
