1371,"\\"" Manchester United is mosl adjusting their roster, and one player that will not be a part of the club next year is Rafael da Silva. Rafael is a fan favorite, but his tendency to take risks has not impressed the current manager, Louis van Gaal, who has left him out of the squad for the last two games.  Rafael has not been seen in the game since January and will have 12 months remaining on his contract this summer, and several clubs in his home country of Brazil are interested in him. \\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.13253012048192772,0.8364747762680054,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,16.067573314066976,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
