1380,"\\"" Tony Pulis, manager of West Bromwich Albion, is requesting that the FA change the rule that doesn't allow teams to appeal yellow card decisions. This appeal comes after Claudio Yacob, a midfielder for the Baggies, received a second yellow card and was sentenced to a suspension for the next game against Aston Villa. This decision was agreed upon as harsh by not only Pulis, but also Tim Sherwood, the opposing team's manager.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.08928571428571429,0.8073974251747131,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,15.379797854926437,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
1381,"\\"" Adnan Januzaj and Marouane Fellaini, teammates on Manchester United and the Belgium national team, have also been shown to be friends off the pitch, frequently spotted out together. The pair were most recently sighted entering a restaurant the night before their match against Newcastle, following a 2-1 win against West Bromwich Albion. They have been noted to celebrate team victories and Fellaini's father has even been seen with them, relaxed, in a center town restaurant recently.
