1442,"\\"" The E! network show ""The Royals"" premiered last week in the US and features a fictional British Royal Family; the show's creators have stated that characters such as Penelope and Maribel are not based on any members of the real royal family, but the similarities between the characters and Princesses Beatrice and Eugenie are striking. Penelope and Maribel's similarity to the two princesses has not gone unnoticed, with an actress on the show admitting that the make-up and wardrobe crew had photos of the princesses for reference when working on their looks.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.3076923076923077,0.894243597984314,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,15.812943370081484,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
