1563,"\\"" Real Madrid are closing in on a deal to sign Porto right back Danilo for £27million. Danilo, who has been wanted by several top European clubs, is reportedly keen on moving to the Bernabeu. The 23-year-old Brazilian has 16 months left contract with Porto, who have tried to negotiate a new deal but have been unsuccessful.

4. How do you think Real Madrid will fare next seizoen following these transfers? 
Against PSG:
In the upcoming season, Real Madrid has a chance to fare well, especially with the acquisition of these new players. The addition of a skilled right-back like Danilo can provide more depth and competition for the position, allowing the team to perform better against strong opponents like PSG.
Against weaker teams:
