1564,"\\"" Maxi Beister, a midfielder for Hamburg, invented a product called the Maxicup, a combination beaker and bowl to help fans carry drinks and snacks without spilling. 4,000 prototype cups were distributed at a recent Hamburg match, and Beister's company, Future Cup, is planning to trial the product at cinemas as well. Beister came idea for the product three years ago while trying to juggle a cup of Coke and a bowl of snacks at the cinema.  Park 2016 conse polymer clay miniature chess set sketch based on web search result.  It is great that Maxi Beister invented the Maxicup, a product that can help fans carry drinks and snacks without spilling anything. I find it interesting that he came up with idea for the product by thinking about his own personal experience, trying to juggle a cup of Coke and a bowl of snacks at the cinema. It's also great that he's not only a professional football player but also an inventor, and he's found a way to combine his passion with his duty.   TestMy, uploaded 8 months ago\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.09243697478991597,0.7941497564315796,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,25.902485611382872,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
