1592,"\\"" A grandmother in Western Australia is outraged after her 9-year old grandson was given the same mobile phone number as a Melbourne brothel. The grandmother, named Margaret, said that her grandson received scores of calls from would-be customers, and she found out about the mishap after listening to a radio station where an anonymous caller reported that someone else had accidentally received the same number as a well-known West Coast Eagles player. The player, Nic Naitanuis, reportedly received a similar number after the telco company's provisioning system failed. 1. A grandmother in Western Australia is outraged after her grandson was given the same mobile phone number as a Melbourne brothel. 2. The grandmother, named Margaret, said that her grandson received scores of calls from would-be customers, and she found out about the mishap after listening to radio station where an anonymous caller reported that someone else had an accidentally received the same number as a well-known West Coast Eagles player. 3. The player, Nic Naitanui, reportedly received a similar number after the telco company's provisioning system failed.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.08547008547008546,0.7999572157859802,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,25.18316960381344,19.43639003896387,28.355174