 decis Om then please sed have v This rare occurrence has sparked curiosity and fascination. The family is embracing the birthmark and seeing it as a unique aspect of their baby. They are not worried about it and are focusing on giving their baby the best possible care and upbringing. This story highlights the diversity and unpredictability of human development. While the cause of the birthmark is unknown, it does not affect the baby's health or well-being. Perfectly safe, and could be treated if needed.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.07287449392712551,0.8004555702209473,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,29.630875159054995,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
