Fiorentina’s win over Inter Milan was a significant one, as it marked the first time in 20 years that the Viola have won at the San Siro.
Mohamed Salah, loaned by Chelsea to Fiorentina, scored the winning goal for his team.
Fiorentina had two players injured and they ended the game with nine men.
