1725,"\\"" Tracy Leann Bess-Thacker, 29, has been arrest and charged with fourth degree theft after she scammed adoptive parents out of money by claiming they would adopt her unborn baby. She used a sonogram and hospital photos from previous pregnancies to trick them. This is not her first time scamming adoptive parents, in 2011 she used 19 different aliases to scam parents from Nebraska, Illinois, Hawaii, Iowa, and Kansas. 
* canmusic50gender 2 months ago
This hits really close to home for me as we have been trying to adopt a child for the past year and a half and have been taken advantage of similar to this couple. We had a woman claim to be pregnant and have a sonogram and everything, however after months of talking and planning she suddenly disappeared and we never heard from her again. It' s scary to think about all of the people out there that will explo exploise the desire of parents to have a child for their own personal gain. I'm glad to see this womку being brought to justice, I just wish there was more that could be done to stop people like this\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.12578616352201258,0.8019223213195801,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,26.37345763295889,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
1726,"\\"" A man was stopped by police in Manchester as he was about to use a saw to remove a wheel clamp from his car, which had been immobilized by the DVLA for not being taxed. No arrests were made as the officers intervened before damage was done to the clamp. The DVLA has the power to immediately clamp or impound any car that is not properly taxed, and motorists who have been clamped have to provide evidence that they have taxed their car before it can be released.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.04444444444444444,0.8269456028938293,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,14.495141429826617,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
1727,"\\""  A sailing boat was spotted struggling in strong winds and rain on Sydney Harbour while a ferry was passing by. The sailing boat was seen struggling to keep afloat and on course, with its sail full of wind, before it collided with the ferry, causing horror among passengers. The incident occurred on Sunday afternoon, when a storm was rolling in over Sydney, bringing 100km/h winds, torrential rain and hail, marking the end of summer and the start of autumn in dramatic fashion.  Keywords: 100km/h winds, hail, record high temperatures, severe storms, southern New South Wales, Sydney, Sydney Harbour, torrential rain.\\""",378718,3067.5191407618113,123.46068031573758,0.12987012987012989,0.8220775723457336,242.2966472459957,2769.0292062722147,0.0073115859459339525,47791,330928,0.7468863446918736,0.9709044004636865,0.6246599436434022,0.8707053661346436,0.9814453125,0.7531242370605469,0.005093595646321773,0.90283203125,0.004411783218383789,0.03149145878851414,0.912109375,0.02670785188674927,0.07989123985171319,0.92333984375,0.06586153954267501,0.6705261628488304,0.9709919088616319,0.6274156287610462,19194,35179,6.965184926342118,0.06521027950613029,0.03553418528009701,0.04300674889223146,2823.3818949805573,9.053635785456859,2.4898926747942065,10.86098589501236,6.088091803124744e-07,1.5158695184074954e-06,4.7491470219484163e-07,1.1824866381470082e-06,0.051926174663538105,0.07601437242701649,0.07917017377912997,17.162074846215546,19.43639003896387,28.355174992000673,30.12591182033065,17029,0
