  In addition, recent rollbacks to work safety laws have resulted in concerns about the prospect of more asbestos dumping in the future. This has led to calls for tougher penalties for dumping and more resources being devoted to enforcement. There are fears that asbestos contractors are not operating safely and properly, which could result in further releases of dangerous materials.  
