2158,"\\"" Orbi Yokohama museum in Japan is launching a “Frog Menu” to celebrate the opening of their Deadly Po poisonous animals. The “Frog Burger” will feature a deep-fried amphibian sandwiched between a black bun, and will cost $1,000 yen. The menu also includes a tamer frog-themed dessert, “Frog Egg Sweet,” which includes a frog and eggs made from almond tofu and jelly, for $580 yen. 



